5〗，而策并江东。曹公力未能逞，且欲抚之：﹝九﹞乃以弟女配策小弟匡，又为子（章）〔彰〕取贲女〖26〗；","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":217,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":60,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-e-p033a-q","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-9ebb5666992014a8e4ec","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏书》曰：“策当嗣侯，让与弟匡。”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":209,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5362f95aae52d3669e9b","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-q-b-edbdfa2f80dd07737f08","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-edbdfa2f80dd07737f08","layer":"modern","quote":"〖21〗权：即孙权（公元 182—252）。传见本书卷四十七。翊：即孙翊（公元 184—？）。匡：即孙匡。孙翊与孙匡传均见本书卷五十一。","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":156,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-854d09852a4a6a970b3a","start":0,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-q-o023","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-fc3c2f12c30733800b35","layer":"original","quote":"坚四子：策、权、翊、匡〖21〗。权既称尊号〖22〗，谥坚曰武烈皇帝〖23〗。﹝七﹞","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":134,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-q-o033","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-fe64807ea9dcb47036d8","layer":"original","quote":"是时，袁绍方强〖25〗，而策并江东。曹公力未能逞，且欲抚之：﹝九﹞乃以弟女配策小弟匡，又为子（章）〔彰〕取贲女〖26〗；皆礼辟策弟权、翊；又命扬州刺吏严象，举权茂才〖27〗。","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":217,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":87,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-q-p031","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-2bb8a4c16eea9112d005","layer":"pei","quote":"《志林》曰：“坚有五子：策、权、翊、匡，吴氏所生；少子朗，庶生也，一名仁。”","attribution":"《志林》","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":175,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-dfa6547151f4d194f8a1","start":0,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-q-p033","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-9ebb5666992014a8e4ec","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏书》曰：“策当嗣侯，让与弟匡。”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":209,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5362f95aae52d3669e9b","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-1eddf4fd2d10d027a0b6","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-dcf1b2545724bbf7e2d7","layer":"original","quote":"举孝廉、茂才。未试用，卒，时年二十余","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":159,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":10,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-5054cc1b3f953ba2926f","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-ed5ad5f26ebf8a9ed071","layer":"pei","quote":"权别其族为丁氏，禁锢终身","attribution":"裴注·江表传","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":170,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2e477cf123d96200cb3b","start":62,"end":74,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-e779c3e3fb805e4b2d4e","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-ed5ad5f26ebf8a9ed071","layer":"pei","quote":"时匡为定武中郎将，（遣）〔违〕范令放火，烧损茅芒。以乏军用，范即启送匡还吴","attribution":"裴注·江表传","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":170,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2e477cf123d96200cb3b","start":24,"end":61,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q2-d35eacf1577190447494","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-ed5ad5f26ebf8a9ed071","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之按：本传曰：“匡未试用，卒，时年二十余。”而《江表传》云吕范在洞口，匡为定武中郎将。既为定武，非为未试用。且孙坚以初平二年卒，洞口之役在黄初三年，坚卒至此合三十一年；匡时若尚在，本传不得云卒时年二十余也。此盖权别生弟朗，《江表传》误以为匡也。朗之名位，见《三朝录》及虞喜《志林》也。","attribution":"裴松之按","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":170,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2e477cf123d96200cb3b","start":76,"end":220,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q2-d6355e52f1ff4e46fd4b","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-03ea69a8190928bde76f","layer":"original","quote":"子泰，曹氏之甥也〖1〗。为长水校尉。嘉禾三年，从权围新城，中流矢死。泰子秀为前将军，夏口督〖2〗。","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":160,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
